description:
Synthetic local overload proof. Read-only Grafana metrics only, datasource sre-demo-prometheus. Use exactly query_grafana_metrics, no alert/shell/write tools. Omit service_name when using PromQL expressions. Investigate the rising P95 and peak traffic. Query the following expressions to independently verify evidence. No real production service is involved. No logs, traces, deployments or dependency evidence are configured. Baseline supplied from a direct Prometheus snapshot: {"incoming_rps": 199.93599487959034, "successful_rps": 198.93591487318983, "error_percent": 0.5002000800320128, "p95_seconds": 0.42, "queue_depth": 8.0, "worker_utilization": 0.35, "rejected_rps": 0.0, "phase": 0.0}. Incident sample timestamp 1791371353.122. For instant gauges append @ 1791371353.122; for rate expressions put @ 1791371353.122 after the range selector [30s]. Queries:
incoming_rps: sum(rate(sre_demo_requests_total{job="checkout-demo"}[30s]))
successful_rps: sum(rate(sre_demo_requests_total{job="checkout-demo",status="200"}[30s]))
error_percent: 100 * sum(rate(sre_demo_requests_total{job="checkout-demo",status="500"}[30s])) / sum(rate(sre_demo_requests_total{job="checkout-demo"}[30s]))
p95_seconds: sre_demo_latency_seconds{job="checkout-demo"}
queue_depth: sre_demo_queue_depth{job="checkout-demo"}
worker_utilization: sre_demo_worker_utilization{job="checkout-demo"}
rejected_rps: sum(rate(sre_demo_admission_rejections_total{job="checkout-demo"}[30s]))
phase: sre_demo_incident_phase{job="checkout-demo"}
Return a standalone final incident report with observed values, impact, ranked hypotheses, uncertainties, prioritized engineer-reviewed mitigations, verification queries and rollback conditions. Do not claim a dependency/deployment root cause, compute remaining error budget, or execute fixes. For comparison use an illustrative 99% success objective and P95 below 500 ms; not an actual customer SLO. Final response must include the report, not just a completion acknowledgement.
